cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research artifact, please cite it as below."
title: "Kev Context-Robustness Study"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Velorin Intelligence"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-09-22
repository-code: "https://github.com/tmo1885-lang/kev-context-robustness-study"
abstract: >-
  Independent experiments on context robustness in Kev, an open-source
  Jev-inspired typed decision model. The frozen artifact compares Kev-0.8B
  and Kev-4B across context, instruction, option-schema, source-order,
  option-order, calibration, task-domain, and LoRA-adaptation controls.
keywords:
  - decision models
  - context robustness
  - semantic inference
  - model evaluation
  - Kev
